# Vietnamese (Tiếng Việt) catalogue of the CaptureMann UI.
# Entries marked `#, fuzzy` are drafts (86 entries added after the Nov 6, 2026 full review: Windows and Linux wording); the app shows them anyway.
# The rest of the catalogue was reviewed by the maintainer (native reading: 0.2.0 strings Oct 27, 2026; the remaining draft sheet Nov 6, 2026) and carries no `fuzzy` flag.
# Entries with `# FACT: owner review required` state what the app really does (privacy, permissions,
# deletion, confirmations): read each one. Terms follow locales/vi-glossary.md.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: CaptureMann\n"
"Language: vi\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
